# New knowledge files are PRIVATE by default. Only bundled synthetic samples
# are tracked. Explicitly review and force-add a safe file if you mean to share it.
/knowledge/*
!/knowledge/approvals.md
!/knowledge/customer_operations.md
!/knowledge/incident_response.md
!/knowledge/integrations.md
!/knowledge/sample_tasks.csv
